This license covers the tooling in this repository — the scripts, the conversion,
the workflows, and the repository structure. It does not cover the sources under
`docs/`.

A source is a document someone else published, reproduced here so it can be
compared against the original. The rights to that content belong to its
publisher. The Norwegian sources are free to reproduce under
[åndsverklova § 14](https://lovdata.no/lov/2018-06-15-40/§14), which places laws,
regulations, judicial decisions, and public reports outside copyright protection.
Each source's `README.md` names its publisher and the grounds on which it may be
kept here.

